postalkit

This package includes postal code data derived from Google's libaddressinput
address data (https://github.com/google/libaddressinput), retrieved from
https://chromium-i18n.appspot.com/ssl-address/data and licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license (CC-BY 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Changes: patterns were rewritten into a compact, separator-free form,
optimized, and corrected where noted in scripts/overrides.ts; canonical
formats, labels and prefixes were derived or added. No libaddressinput source
code is included.
